 IE_HTML_WithinFormWithParms;txt;n;res;text;changeFlag;Done;parms;code;ref
⍝ IE With some parameters and local HTML.

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''

 parms←##.GUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'IE test'
 ref←##.GUI.StdForm.Create parms
 n←##.GUI.IE.CreateIE ref.∆Form

 #.Temp.html1←⊂'<h1>Demo for the IE object</h1>'
 #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>Very simple demo for the IE object</p>'
 #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>Internal <a href="!first">link 1</a></p>'
 #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>Internal <a href="!second">link 2</a></p>'
 #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>External link to the <a href="http://aplwiki.com">APL Wiki</a></p>'
 #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p><a href="!404">Dead link</a></p>'

 #.Temp.html2←⊂'<h1>Sub-page 1</h1>'
 #.Temp.html2,←⊂'<p>This is the very first sub page</p>'
 #.Temp.html2,←⊂'<p><a href="!home">Go Back</a></p>'

 #.Temp.html3←⊂'<h1>Sub-page 2</h1>'
 #.Temp.html3,←⊂'<p>This is the second sub page</p>'
 #.Temp.html3,←⊂'<p><a href="!home">Go Back</a></p>'

 code←''
 code,←⊂'{r}←n OnNavigate page;i'
 code,←⊂'⎕IO←0 ⋄ ⎕ML←3'
 code,←⊂' r←1'
 code,←⊂' i←''home'' ''first'' ''second''⍳⊂page'
 code,←⊂' :If 3>i'
 code,←⊂'    ##.GUI.IE.ShowHtml n.IEobject (i⊃#.Temp.(html1 html2 html3))'
 code,←⊂' :Else'
 code,←⊂'    ##.GUI.IE.ShowHtml n.IEobject ''<h1>404 Page Not found</h1>'''
 code,←⊂' :EndIf'
 #.Temp.⎕FX code

 parms←##.GUI.IE.CreateParms
 parms.onNavigate←'#.Temp.OnNavigate'
 parms.redirectHttpToDefaultBrowser←1
 n←parms ##.GUI.IE.CreateIE ref.∆Form
 n.∆Form←ref
 n.∆Form.n←n

 ##.GUI.IE.ShowHtml n.IEobject #.Temp.html1
 ⎕DQ ref.∆Form
⍝Done
